<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Gillette buy of Duracell - EU source.</title>
<headline>EU clears Gillette buy of Duracell - EU source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared the proposed takeover of U.S. battery maker Duracell International Inc by the Gillette Company, another U.S. company which makes shaving products, an EU source said on Friday.</p>
<p>The deal was submitted to the European Union executive for clearance on October 4.</p>
<p>Although both Gillette and Duracell are non-European they do a vast amount of business in the EU which is why the deal must get Commission clearance.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
</text>
